    "atom::4ecae2ad21b9875306feb272": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4ecae2ad21b9875306feb272",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知特定微生物群与ICB疗效相关，但确切的分子机制尚不清楚，这限制了将微生物作为精准医疗手段加以利用的能力。本文试图回答：哪些具体的微生物分子特征（蛋白质、酶、代谢物）介导了这种调节作用？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1630a826b24d749d3709a3bf49bb190dc1c91b2d99b435909b4b8100f5df9232",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::68dac395c061b642520773c2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::68dac395c061b642520773c2",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "人类微生物群（特别是肠道菌群）与癌症免疫治疗中免疫检查点阻断（ICB，如抗PD-1/PD-L1和抗CTLA-4抗体）疗效之间的关系。研究范围涵盖从宏观的菌群组成相关性到微观的分子机制（代谢物、蛋白质、抗原模拟），以及基于这些机制的工程化益生菌策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6daa8d9e17e15ff52be1eb679052764da5a08f78276ff5022253e560b4eba344",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c8095064895dfad406e569df": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c8095064895dfad406e569df",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在总结宿主-微生物相互作用在检查点抑制剂免疫治疗背景下的分子理解进展。文章首先回顾了通过小鼠模型和患者队列建立的菌群与ICB疗效之间的相关性，指出仅凭分类学关联难以确定因果关系。随后，重点阐述了具体的微生物分子机制，包括短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）、肌苷（inosine）、环二腺苷酸（cdAMP）、肽聚糖片段（muropeptides）和鞭毛蛋白（flagellin）如何分别通过T细胞刺激、髓系细胞激活或分子模拟来增强抗肿瘤免疫。最后，讨论了利用这些分子特征设计下一代工程化益生菌以改善治疗反应的潜力，并指出了当前研究在真菌/古菌、抑制性微生物及远端器官微生物方面的局限。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b2a809b9e127327ba749e5f74b667be833253e2c5b1256d536c3b146ac8288e3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a33a88e41466a66d3f707572": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a33a88e41466a66d3f707572",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为解释肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤免疫检查点阻断疗效提供了丰富的分子机制素材。它不仅列出了关键的关联物种，更重点揭示了具体的效应分子（如cdAMP, inosine, muropeptides）及其对应的宿主受体和信号通路，是构建“机制”部分的核心参考。同时，文中关于工程化益生菌的设计思路为讨论未来治疗策略提供了具体案例。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::873b0b1f0e5bb26a6a8f3a3e6577a9432e01cdf88defaa8003717274808e4dc0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::599e6bf17709ba8cfbd90929": {
      "atom_id": "atom::599e6bf17709ba8cfbd90929",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些机制大多基于小鼠模型或体外实验，部分已在早期临床试验中探索（如MRx0518），但尚未成为标准治疗指南；不同菌株间存在显著差异，不能简单外推至所有同种细菌。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群影响ICB疗效的具体生物学途径和关键分子中介。例如，明确了A. muciniphila通过cdAMP-STING轴、肠球菌通过SagA-NOD2轴、以及双歧杆菌通过肌苷-A2AR轴增强抗肿瘤免疫的具体机制。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::593cbabbfb7b7f146cb622499585829902d8cef810355da0af69aae61654cb31",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fc6d3aca503ebb017c84ebed": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fc6d3aca503ebb017c84ebed",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤ICB疗效”的问题，提供具体的分子层面的解释，而非仅仅停留在菌群丰度的统计关联上。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0c838fbaf4faa85f45a53e2762a9a59a83e40df7240462796259ea5ad633bb37",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2a57617739887231108e77d5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2a57617739887231108e77d5",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制的复杂性在于多种微生物可能通过相同或不同的路径产生相似效果（冗余性），且单一代谢物往往不足以完全重现体内复杂的生态效应（如肌苷需配合TLR9激动剂）。",
        "contribution": "详细描述了介导效应的具体分子机制，包括代谢物（SCFAs, inosine, cdAMP）、蛋白质（SagA, flagellin）和抗原模拟（TMP）。解释了这些分子如何被宿主受体识别并触发下游信号级联反应（如I型干扰素产生、Th1分化、CD8+ T细胞浸润）。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::593cbabbfb7b7f146cb622499585829902d8cef810355da0af69aae61654cb31",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::89998a188375ccf4789bdc05": {
      "atom_id": "atom::89998a188375ccf4789bdc05",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "直接支撑“什么机制介导了该效应”的子问题，提供详细的信号通路图谱和分子互作细节。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
