    "atom::3730e786b8b2831b6d7fa00a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3730e786b8b2831b6d7fa00a",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的许多机制（如cdAMP, SagA）主要在小鼠模型中验证，其在人体内的确切效力和安全性仍需更多临床数据支持。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f11f183a1d165c684b44b5c2c043e3e3f5031a4695284eddf50b73d783ec0b57",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e90d9bb4a7244676654bef0a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e90d9bb4a7244676654bef0a",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "作者强调“还原论”方法的优势，但这并不意味着生态方法无效，两者应被视为互补而非对立。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f11f183a1d165c684b44b5c2c043e3e3f5031a4695284eddf50b73d783ec0b57",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3abfe02af60077a50b3004b3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3abfe02af60077a50b3004b3",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "不同菌株甚至同一物种的不同菌株之间可能存在巨大的功能差异（如Bifidobacterium bifidum的不同菌株对PD-1阻断的影响不同），因此在引用具体机制时需严格限定菌株来源。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6c9adb8dafbf57ee773f2f0979d81c6a6b1ef9f270b51ab7fbbe22075859a989",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f11f183a1d165c684b44b5c2c043e3e3f5031a4695284eddf50b73d783ec0b57",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0d593217581a78566b8d13de": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0d593217581a78566b8d13de",
      "source_handle": "P0251",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "SCFAs（特别是丁酸盐）对ICB的影响具有情境依赖性（如对CTLA-4可能有负面作用），不能一概而论地认为其总是有益。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a711d661f19a142c0c3e45ea8a35fa3da456e65d9624ddb0a9e7af0f413aa26a",
