    "atom::972e64916e571eefa7631020": {
      "atom_id": "atom::972e64916e571eefa7631020",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "研究采用多步骤实验设计：首先，使用六种临床相关抗生素处理C57BL/6J小鼠，建立不同的肠道菌群和代谢组状态，并结合ICT治疗评估肿瘤生长；其次，利用液相色谱-质谱联用技术（LC-MS）对粪便、血清和肿瘤组织进行非靶向代谢组学 profiling，筛选与肿瘤负荷相关的代谢物，并通过靶向定量验证候选分子（TDCA）；再次，通过体内回补实验测试不同胆汁酸对抗生素诱导的ICT低响应的挽救作用；接着，利用单细胞RNA测序（scRNA-seq）、流式细胞术和多因子蛋白检测分析肿瘤微环境中免疫细胞亚群的变化；最后，通过抗体耗竭实验确定关键效应细胞，并利用OT-I转基因小鼠模型和TGR5拮抗剂（SBI-115）在体外和体内验证TDCA通过TGR5受体直接增强CD8+ T细胞细胞毒性的机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1ea36910bf91cf680714f02e1915a8995dd903729962933a51fbc6c12502b3e3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::04d1653e627f38a25eb88134": {
      "atom_id": "atom::04d1653e627f38a25eb88134",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "识别出微生物衍生的胆汁酸TDCA是连接抗生素诱导的菌群紊乱与ICT低响应的关键代谢介质。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代TDCA在人体内的确切药代动力学特征及长期安全性数据；机制研究主要在预临床小鼠模型中进行，人类相关性主要基于之前的回顾性临床关联数据，缺乏前瞻性患者验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4165e866bcb6923e923579f2817262233dcf5a29b29db07defd082fda9794e40",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e73cb7c8039043ab17f7ea02": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e73cb7c8039043ab17f7ea02",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "证明了单一微生物代谢物的补充即可逆转抗生素引起的免疫治疗失效，无需重建整个微生物组。",
        "limits": "未明确驱动TDCA丧失的具体微生物类群和酶促途径；TGR5的作用可能涉及其他细胞类型，本研究主要依赖药理学拮抗剂而非基因敲除，无法完全排除脱靶效应或其他细胞类型的贡献。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4165e866bcb6923e923579f2817262233dcf5a29b29db07defd082fda9794e40",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a8acea12fabd6b703f06ba14": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a8acea12fabd6b703f06ba14",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "阐明了TDCA通过TGR5受体直接增强CD8+ T细胞细胞毒性的新机制，区别于其他代谢物对T细胞分化的间接调节。",
        "limits": "TDCA对CD8+ T细胞下游的具体信号转导通路（如cAMP-PKA-mTOR）尚未完全阐明；TDCA的疗效可能具有肿瘤类型、免疫背景和剂量依赖性，其在其他实体瘤中的普适性需进一步验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4165e866bcb6923e923579f2817262233dcf5a29b29db07defd082fda9794e40",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7fea3693f3c5f89fd8b539c0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7fea3693f3c5f89fd8b539c0",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "C57BL/6J小鼠接种B16-F10黑色素瘤细胞，接受青霉素/链霉素（Pen/Strep）等抗生素处理及ICT治疗",
        "finding": "Pen/Strep处理显著减少肠道细菌总量并改变菌群结构，导致肿瘤体积增大和生存期缩短，表明抗生素特异性地降低了ICT的疗效而非直接影响肿瘤 intrinsic 生长。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::106fc4a9b5ba73e41d07332d89a299c9c60100fcf7593526adfacac2614f326e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8437e3e49f9c6298637b1691": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8437e3e49f9c6298637b1691",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "非靶向代谢组学分析与临床数据交叉验证",
        "finding": "抗生素处理重塑了宿主代谢组，其中牛磺脱氧胆酸（TDCA）在肿瘤、血清和盲肠内容物中呈现一致的变化趋势，且在人类黑色素瘤ICT响应者中富集，被鉴定为ICT响应的关键代谢物。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::106fc4a9b5ba73e41d07332d89a299c9c60100fcf7593526adfacac2614f326e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4a5fd9f87fca22b5def42a90": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4a5fd9f87fca22b5def42a90",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "Pen/Strep处理后靶向定量肿瘤内胆汁酸",
        "finding": "抗生素处理导致肿瘤内初级结合胆汁酸（如TCDCA）增加，而微生物衍生的次级胆汁酸TDCA显著耗竭。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::106fc4a9b5ba73e41d07332d89a299c9c60100fcf7593526adfacac2614f326e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3ce8b9357b67d5a78510ea79": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3ce8b9357b67d5a78510ea79",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "在抗生素+ICT背景下，向肿瘤内局部注射五种受抗生素影响的胆汁酸",
        "finding": "仅TDCA补充能显著抑制肿瘤生长并延长生存期，且仅在抗生素存在时发挥挽救作用，不影响无抗生素背景下的ICT疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::106fc4a9b5ba73e41d07332d89a299c9c60100fcf7593526adfacac2614f326e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d4be51fd1e5e2dbe963267ba": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d4be51fd1e5e2dbe963267ba",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "在E0771乳腺癌模型和人源化NSG-SGM3小鼠A375黑色素瘤模型中补充TDCA",
        "finding": "TDCA补充在多种肿瘤模型中均能克服抗生素诱导的ICT低响应，显示其效应的广泛性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
