    "atom::870daf920ef09f8d06d5dd8d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::870daf920ef09f8d06d5dd8d",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究的机制结论主要基于小鼠模型，虽然引用了之前的人类队列数据作为关联支持，但TDCA在人体内的确切疗效和安全性尚未在本研究中得到前瞻性验证。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c84f8ec91b79bac47c6cbd2e4085bab1c16c5c262036bc997a27cff99b329e17",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0cd327c27a8ebee5fd1f368a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0cd327c27a8ebee5fd1f368a",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "TDCA的作用依赖于TGR5受体，但其下游信号通路（如cAMP-PKA-mTOR）的具体运作机制在本研究中仅为推测，需结合后续研究谨慎解读。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c84f8ec91b79bac47c6cbd2e4085bab1c16c5c262036bc997a27cff99b329e17",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c333cd1be808b2bc7d897b03": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c333cd1be808b2bc7d897b03",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "不同胆汁酸在不同肿瘤类型中具有相反的免疫调节作用（如DCA在结直肠癌中抑制免疫，而在本研究中TDCA在黑色素瘤中促进免疫），因此在跨肿瘤类型推广时需特别注意上下文差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c84f8ec91b79bac47c6cbd2e4085bab1c16c5c262036bc997a27cff99b329e17",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bd7fef3939ea77630336d1de": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bd7fef3939ea77630336d1de",
      "source_handle": "P0481",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "抗生素对ICT的影响并非均一，不同抗生素导致的菌群和代谢组变化不同，因此不能简单地将所有抗生素视为同等负面因素。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3655ccef0398dfb4668a60473ea2994f2955bd800b708f1ff71f10ca31884a95",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c84f8ec91b79bac47c6cbd2e4085bab1c16c5c262036bc997a27cff99b329e17",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
