    },
    "atom::ece6acafa06099b8b6423101": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ece6acafa06099b8b6423101",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "empirical",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5996a0e92fc17ec44c3969d568f763e9f7e78c41775cac39f76301be2021b323",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::60020e34ec4b8c77e0d8f810": {
      "atom_id": "atom::60020e34ec4b8c77e0d8f810",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "目前缺乏有效的生物标志物来预测uHCC患者对ICI治疗的反应。尽管有证据表明肠道微生物群可能调节肿瘤对免疫治疗的反应，但在HCC中的具体作用尚不明确。本研究试图回答：uHCC患者的基线肠道微生物组和代谢物是否与ICI治疗结局相关？能否识别出预测生存期的微生物特征？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::57636ab2a88cc993c7ef1c3a8a870f1cc4864f3ef0ff0329e903e5bb13bd1414",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::0201844e7f6258c10ee9924c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0201844e7f6258c10ee9924c",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "不可切除肝细胞癌（uHCC）患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗；比较客观缓解（OR）、疾病进展（PD）及健康对照者的粪便微生物组与代谢物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5f8647bc2784045121cf74c512e4c601ac1809fd094bdc0a6c5af3f8c3fd709e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::15e6a333c649c99338c34cf2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::15e6a333c649c99338c34cf2",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探索肠道微生物群及其代谢产物作为预测uHCC患者ICI治疗疗效的生物标志物的潜力。研究采用前瞻性队列设计，在2018年5月至2020年2月期间，纳入94名初治uHCC患者，收集治疗前粪便样本。通过16S rRNA基因测序分析微生物组成，并通过LC-MS和HPLC分析胆汁酸（BA）和短链脂肪酸（SCFA）。训练集包含20例OR患者和21例PD患者，验证集为33例Child-Pugh A级患者。研究发现，基线时OR与PD患者的肠道菌群存在显著差异，特定菌属丰度及次级胆汁酸水平与治疗效果相关，且特定的微生物特征组合可独立预测总生存期（OS）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2cdf67824e438f7b1d88f7e02e46884f9c54ee91d8c853a1af7df03abde96df0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::64bf9d437d1ef2ca6cb18e4b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::64bf9d437d1ef2ca6cb18e4b",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道微生物群如何关联于实体瘤（具体为HCC）中ICI疗效的具体临床证据。它识别了特定的细菌属（Lachnoclostridium, Prevotella 9）和代谢物（次级胆汁酸）作为疗效预测因子，并提出了“微生物-胆汁酸轴”的可能联系。对于综述而言，这篇论文是连接“微生物组成”与“临床预后”的重要实证材料，特别适用于讨论HCC亚型中的特异性微生物特征及其与代谢物的耦合关系。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1041dd18c50e240fe3646ada400dfbe49c61e84d01706b69bb0bb75fcd324956",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::326b44aebea94784d1e576bd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::326b44aebea94784d1e576bd",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限于uHCC人群；主要基于抗PD-1/PD-L1单药或联合TKI治疗，未直接验证阿替利珠单抗+贝伐珠单抗方案；关联性强于因果性。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的微生物特征（Lachnoclostridium富集 + Prevotella 9耗竭）与uHCC患者ICI治疗客观缓解率（ORR）和无进展生存期（PFS）的正向关联证据。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::685b156755b51a0905bfb84491af9a687912c89a517950f887296019513f344f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cc269ad826b7ba52b2d9078e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cc269ad826b7ba52b2d9078e",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物群如何调节ICI疗效”的问题，提供HCC这一特定实体瘤类型的阳性预测因子案例。可用于对比其他癌症类型（如黑色素瘤）中不同的有益菌群。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3021a21b7d9780a482f9c176479079af331ba12ea18cef0f897f1a89a25a57b5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::83aec2be22646133caa52f92": {
      "atom_id": "atom::83aec2be22646133caa52f92",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "相关性而非因果性；机制假设（Clostridium scindens的作用）未被本实验直接证实，仅引用文献支持；未测量免疫细胞浸润或细胞因子水平以直接验证免疫调节机制。",
        "contribution": "揭示了特定细菌（Lachnoclostridium）与特定代谢物（次级胆汁酸UDCA/UCA）之间的强正相关性，并指出这些胆汁酸在响应者中富集。作者推测Lachnoclostridium可能通过转化CDCA生成具有化学预防作用的UDCA来介导效应。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::685b156755b51a0905bfb84491af9a687912c89a517950f887296019513f344f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4521eb13a2243d3c03d57052": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4521eb13a2243d3c03d57052",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "为“机制”部分提供代谢途径的线索。虽然未直接证明免疫激活机制，但建立了“菌-代谢物”关联，提示胆汁酸稳态可能是微生物影响ICI疗效的一个潜在中介变量。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3021a21b7d9780a482f9c176479079af331ba12ea18cef0f897f1a89a25a57b5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::85a98285bb070f39fc5b770b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::85a98285bb070f39fc5b770b",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "引言部分回顾了HCC流行病学、ICI治疗现状（响应率16-20%）、现有生物标志物（PD-L1, CTNNB1, AFP）的局限性，以及肠道微生物群在其他癌症（黑色素瘤）中调节免疫治疗效果的已有证据。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
