    "atom::b157a758206c4af9a002c10c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b157a758206c4af9a002c10c",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究的发现主要基于台湾地区的病毒相关HCC患者，可能不适用于非病毒性HCC或其他种族群体。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ff5a082c113cf08dd9d639be057404e327a09e76c3c631aa1157a5873db44cc5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8540bbaebe850fd2e0ab6a37": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8540bbaebe850fd2e0ab6a37",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "验证队列规模较小（n=33），且主要为Child-Pugh A级，限制了其在晚期肝病人群中的普适性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ff5a082c113cf08dd9d639be057404e327a09e76c3c631aa1157a5873db44cc5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e0f143e6499a564f8b9b8c38": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e0f143e6499a564f8b9b8c38",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "研究未区分ICI单药与联合治疗（如ICI+TKI）对微生物组的潜在不同影响，尽管分析显示既往TKI暴露未显著混淆结果，但联合治疗本身可能改变肠道环境。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ff5a082c113cf08dd9d639be057404e327a09e76c3c631aa1157a5873db44cc5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a0bee8c0a20e76b35b352b7a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a0bee8c0a20e76b35b352b7a",
      "source_handle": "P0424",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "作者声称的“首次包含验证队列”需注意其语境，即针对HCC ICI治疗这一特定细分领域，而非整个微生物组领域。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a43af420403a250e3f63baf03447951c2efc1015280fcab4046f9358bfa219b1",
