    "atom::67c0059d7cc001159ec223da": {
      "atom_id": "atom::67c0059d7cc001159ec223da",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用系统性文献回顾与综合的方法。首先概述胆汁酸的生物学特性（合成、循环、微生物修饰）；其次，深入讨论微生物修饰胆汁酸对局部和全身效应的影响，重点分析FXR和TGR5等关键信号通路；接着，基于上述机制，归纳该轴在代谢紊乱、肝病、免疫失调和癌症等疾病发病机制中的贡献；最后，讨论靶向胆汁酸信号和肠道微生物群的 emerging therapeutic strategies（包括药物、饮食、益生菌/FMT），并指出未来研究方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ca40647414c8c60329aa3c77a8b9617e3d5e1d47538fd84edf87f02fde8e9b3e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::85de1bb0261a846dba4da0ee": {
      "atom_id": "atom::85de1bb0261a846dba4da0ee",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了胆汁酸-微生物-FXR轴的全面机制框架，整合了从基础生化到临床疾病的多个层面，特别强调了微生物衍生胆汁酸对新型受体（如RORγt, VDR）的调节作用。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于已发表的研究，未提供新的实验数据。部分机制（如特定微生物胆汁酸的长期安全性、组织特异性FXR调节的临床转化）仍存在争议或不确定性，需更多研究验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3fabbd7c9d7c37a78bdf22144f54e7c009f63a1113c49073280ecfbc8b861998",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f66274dfbe30a093574d104e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f66274dfbe30a093574d104e",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "微生物群存在时",
        "finding": "肠道微生物通过BSH、bai操纵子等酶系将初级胆汁酸转化为次级/三级胆汁酸（如DCA, LCA, UDCA等），显著增加胆汁酸池的结构多样性和疏水性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17cfa8560bd01bd0e1c2795f48c21a447b5a9b041532bfb9d5fa2685b1eee6f6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d3b5c5db1396b7ca16c20673": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d3b5c5db1396b7ca16c20673",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "FXR激活状态下",
        "finding": "FXR作为胆汁酸稳态的主调控因子，通过抑制CYP7A1减少胆汁酸合成，并通过FGF19/15介导肠-肝通讯调节代谢。组织特异性（肝vs肠）的FXR激活具有不同的代谢后果。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17cfa8560bd01bd0e1c2795f48c21a447b5a9b041532bfb9d5fa2685b1eee6f6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f89226d0f1ee80575413809b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f89226d0f1ee80575413809b",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "特定微生物胆汁酸存在时",
        "finding": "某些微生物衍生的胆汁酸（如3-oxo-LCA, isoalloLCA）可直接结合并调节非经典受体（如RORγt, NR4A1），从而调节Th17/Treg平衡和肠道免疫。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17cfa8560bd01bd0e1c2795f48c21a447b5a9b041532bfb9d5fa2685b1eee6f6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::36dab9c7aa4f16a75eb9549c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::36dab9c7aa4f16a75eb9549c",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "高脂饮食或抗生素处理后",
        "finding": "饮食和环境因素可破坏胆汁酸-微生物轴，导致次级胆汁酸减少、初级胆汁酸积累，进而促进肥胖、脂肪肝、IBD和艰难梭菌感染等疾病。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17cfa8560bd01bd0e1c2795f48c21a447b5a9b041532bfb9d5fa2685b1eee6f6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::44594a369c08a2ddd1daab93": {
      "atom_id": "atom::44594a369c08a2ddd1daab93",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8ca4c918cea2a24ab7b709bf1e750210d2ed1926e353f65db8210e8826a1d51f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6c348e8b52e606d43d9539ef": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6c348e8b52e606d43d9539ef",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "鉴于胆汁酸在宿主-微生物相互作用中的复杂性和重要性，亟需全面梳理胆汁酸-微生物轴的分子机制，特别是其在多种疾病病理生理学中的作用，并探讨基于此轴的治疗策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::81991f41b3ea5dff7f140304dd799b7b950681b90246a8b0e13a1e8016e05734",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::063e2a1ae882f5afddbb1b65": {
      "atom_id": "atom::063e2a1ae882f5afddbb1b65",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肠道微生物群-胆汁酸-FXR信号轴在代谢性疾病、胃肠道疾病、免疫相关疾病及癌症中的分子机制与临床转化潜力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d1c2b0df73c554596ebc17560cd3eced79b81cea331de2feb92bbeb24a6967cc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::801377f5943780bca1d9dd82": {
      "atom_id": "atom::801377f5943780bca1d9dd82",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，系统阐述了肠道微生物群通过酶促修饰改变胆汁酸（BAs）池组成，进而调节宿主核受体（如FXR、TGR5等）信号通路的机制。文章详细描述了初级胆汁酸的合成与肠肝循环、微生物对胆汁酸的脱共轭、去羟基化等生物转化过程，以及这些微生物衍生的胆汁酸如何作为信号分子影响葡萄糖/脂质代谢、肝脏纤维化、肠道炎症、感染防御和肿瘤发生。最后，文章评估了针对该轴的药物治疗、饮食干预和微生物疗法的治疗潜力与挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4f9333070ac50be14e0b049346374051a30fc86d2a8821b85555152465b635ac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a6cd4fb3e1731a47727f1555": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a6cd4fb3e1731a47727f1555",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述虽不直接涉及免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs），但其关于肠道微生物群如何通过胆汁酸代谢产物调节宿主免疫系统（特别是T细胞分化、巨噬细胞极化和肠道屏障功能）的机制描述，为理解微生物群对实体瘤免疫治疗反应的潜在间接影响提供了重要的背景知识和机制类比。它揭示了微生物-代谢物-免疫细胞互作的一般性原则，可作为解释微生物群状态如何塑造抗肿瘤免疫微环境的理论支撑。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::98f654763980f7fd297452daed60df2e3642135c19599c01cfe294727a7cfe27",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1a17e70d8a5c433f1597aa0d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1a17e70d8a5c433f1597aa0d",
      "source_handle": "P0180",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该综述聚焦于代谢和胃肠道炎症疾病中的免疫调节，未直接研究实体瘤中的ICI疗效。其描述的免疫调节主要发生在肠道局部或全身代谢背景下，不一定直接等同于肿瘤微环境中的ICI响应机制。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群通过胆汁酸代谢产物调节宿主适应性免疫（Th17/Treg平衡）和固有免疫（巨噬细胞、ILC3s）的详细分子机制。例如，3-oxo-LCA抑制RORγt从而抑制Th17，isoalloLCA促进Treg分化。这些机制展示了微生物代谢物如何直接塑造免疫细胞表型。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::517e4ff3db173ff08232081b68dabe7dffcd0b1479a5f6de6bd26b9645ae9638",
          "field_path": [
