    "atom::6f25342d3bad59d009d18374": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6f25342d3bad59d009d18374",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用观察性队列设计。首先，对38名HCC患者进行基线或治疗期间的血清采样，使用液相色谱-高分辨质谱（LC-HRMS）定量10种特定的血清吲哚代谢物。其次，根据临床结局（TTP>8个月，RFS>2年）对患者进行分层，使用Kaplan-Meier曲线和Mann-Whitney U检验比较高低代谢物水平组的生存差异。第三，针对其中8名不可切除患者进行粪便样本采集，进行16S v4 rDNA测序以鉴定细菌群落结构。最后，结合实验数据与计算预测（TrpNet工具，基于贝叶斯逻辑回归），将检测到的代谢物与其潜在的微生物来源（细菌科属）进行关联分析。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3e241ae4a3e5d38d53cd830c774b8c9b74bd0e9424e149689f23a4c8a42d6dd2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::09e10c607209fa2459a262d78a3b2f518b93b318ec0931d152e699ad655a03ec",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e5ca089d04dca02121c44868": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e5ca089d04dca02121c44868",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了初步证据，表明血清吲哚丙酸（IPA）水平与不可切除HCC患者对ICI治疗的持久反应（TTP）正相关。",
        "limits": "样本量极小（总N=38，微生物组N=8），结果可能缺乏统计效力；仅针对不可切除患者有显著发现，可切除患者无关联；微生物组与代谢物的因果联系依赖于计算预测（TrpNet）和小样本测序，尚未在大队列中验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3e241ae4a3e5d38d53cd830c774b8c9b74bd0e9424e149689f23a4c8a42d6dd2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8931bae183703bd68ba395e20a8822a916a7fa9f8bce79e5ed084ec0c500f672",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8273ce1dd66befbb9da6a702": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8273ce1dd66befbb9da6a702",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "识别了与ICI初始响应相关的特定细菌科（Pasteurellaceae, Lachnospiraceae）及其代谢产物前体。",
        "limits": "细菌丰度变化与临床响应的因果关系未确立；TrpNet工具的预测准确性依赖于已知数据库，可能存在偏差；摘要未提供具体的P值或置信区间，难以评估效应大小。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3e241ae4a3e5d38d53cd830c774b8c9b74bd0e9424e149689f23a4c8a42d6dd2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8931bae183703bd68ba395e20a8822a916a7fa9f8bce79e5ed084ec0c500f672",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6692abd574e774a546b124b4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6692abd574e774a546b124b4",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
