    "atom::c758f86153459a5d38b36c65": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c758f86153459a5d38b36c65",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管免疫检查点抑制剂是HCC最有前景的治疗手段，但患者反应异质性大，急需延长生存的策略。具体问题是：能否找到微生物来源的代谢物作为ICI持久反应的生物标志物？这些代谢物的微生物来源是什么？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3e241ae4a3e5d38d53cd830c774b8c9b74bd0e9424e149689f23a4c8a42d6dd2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::76484bca57e74cd4d6900534e2814e0d40069ce4d0f92fd47d884e52b411c7ef",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::12e13cb458d5910465edb27d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::12e13cb458d5910465edb27d",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "不可切除、新辅助及辅助治疗阶段的肝细胞癌（HCC）患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI，包括anti-PD1/PL1方案如nivo+/-ipi, atezo+bev）治疗。研究涉及血清代谢物分析与粪便微生物组测序，样本量较小（38名患者测代谢物，8名患者测微生物组）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3e241ae4a3e5d38d53cd830c774b8c9b74bd0e9424e149689f23a4c8a42d6dd2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4f294f1029aa6c79bd0aaa70a7a6e9cec90ed3140b7586a4b2c90a6ef279a009",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::cfd8dd39d204ce91cf712e92": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cfd8dd39d204ce91cf712e92",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在识别与HCC患者ICI持久反应相关的微生物来源代谢物生物标志物，并探索其微生物来源。研究团队在38名接受ICI治疗的HCC患者中通过LC-HRMS测量了10种血清吲哚代谢物，并通过Kaplan-Me分析和Mann-Whitney U检验评估了时间至进展（TTP）和无复发生存期（RFS）。同时，在8名不可切除患者的重叠队列中进行16S v4 rDNA测序以表征肠道微生物组，并使用TrpNet工具预测代谢物的潜在微生物来源。研究发现，在不可切除患者中，升高水平的吲哚丙酸（IPA）与改善的预后相关，且初步关联了特定细菌家族与IPA及其前体的产生。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3e241ae4a3e5d38d53cd830c774b8c9b74bd0e9424e149689f23a4c8a42d6dd2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::755d0a08f9d0b5452e89af9a1cbfef5ba48287922008203bf3ef12d64b160c19",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::870b5f35d127537f370968e0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::870b5f35d127537f370968e0",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物代谢物（特别是吲哚类）调节实体瘤（HCC）免疫治疗反应的具体实证素材。它直接连接了“微生物-代谢物-宿主免疫”轴与ICI疗效，指出了特定代谢物（IPA）和细菌科（Pasteurellaceae, Lachnospiraceae）作为潜在生物标志物的价值，同时也揭示了当前研究的局限性（小样本、特定亚组有效），适合用于讨论机制的复杂性和生物标志物转化的挑战。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3e241ae4a3e5d38d53cd830c774b8c9b74bd0e9424e149689f23a4c8a42d6dd2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9a289f1eb18017a62e2d98fed489045e846cbf057c1bb0ccb7eed69b8bc885bd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::61a6c6feff3f391baf725303": {
      "atom_id": "atom::61a6c6feff3f391baf725303",
      "source_handle": "P0209",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限不可切除HCC患者；样本量小；未涵盖所有类型的实体瘤；相关性不等于因果性。",
        "contribution": "提供了HCC患者中血清IPA水平与ICI治疗持久反应（TTP）正相关的临床观察数据。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3e241ae4a3e5d38d53cd830c774b8c9b74bd0e9424e149689f23a4c8a42d6dd2",
