    "atom::400987067f9112654469f325": {
      "atom_id": "atom::400987067f9112654469f325",
      "source_handle": "P0363",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管ICI改变了多种恶性肿瘤的治疗格局，但持久响应率仍然有限。需要厘清肠道微生物组作为系统性免疫调节因子，如何通过代谢产物重塑肿瘤微环境（TME）从而影响ICI疗效；同时需要评估将微生物组特征转化为临床预测生物标志物或治疗策略的可行性与局限性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9d36bdf3513e6445337f93a3a961bc3608c82c611",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::34a888801e8e6d821b26426340c87e03f660d9e8ccd4d5483b2edf8d0e593eaa",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8d3f3fb713012e6d46c4350d11f0ffff38c9e7b4560eeb181222847482438e1b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::89c40541a350639004f2a39b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::89c40541a350639004f2a39b",
      "source_handle": "P0363",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "聚焦肠道微生物组（gut microbiome）对实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，如抗PD-1/PD-L1、抗CTLA-4）疗效的系统性调节作用。明确排除肿瘤内微生物组（intratumoral microbiome），主要涵盖黑色素瘤和非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）等实体瘤的临床与机制证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9d36bdf3513e6445337f93a3a961bc3608c82c611",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::34a888801e8e6d821b26426340c87e03f660d9e8ccd4d5483b2edf8d0e593eaa",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::05dc7aaaee6451479debeddc35c7f4ac59ebdd9d7b3dc775c7a562ab35d0269a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4eb0ae361131e5d9242f99aa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4eb0ae361131e5d9242f99aa",
      "source_handle": "P0363",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在整合肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效的机制证据与临床发现。文章提出并应用“微生物组→代谢物→免疫调节→TME状态→ICI反应”的统一操作框架，系统梳理了短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）、次级胆汁酸、色氨酸代谢物和多胺等关键代谢轴的作用机制。同时，文章批判性地评估了现有临床关联研究、粪菌移植（FMT）概念验证试验及饮食/益生菌干预的证据等级，指出目前尚无经临床验证的生物标志物，并基于当前证据为临床医生提供了抗生素管理、饮食建议及实验性疗法使用的具体指导原则。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9d36bdf3513e6445337f93a3a961bc3608c82c611",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::34a888801e8e6d821b26426340c87e03f660d9e8ccd4d5483b2edf8d0e593eaa",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::61112418a744f511bb918ff5235179d2d5b9f312f382a17e11bce64a60d0cda2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::68caaada83db2b18ac5c6e97": {
      "atom_id": "atom::68caaada83db2b18ac5c6e97",
      "source_handle": "P0363",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤ICI疗效提供了全面的机制背景和临床现状评估。其核心价值在于提供了一个整合性的分析框架（代谢物-免疫-TME），并详细区分了已确立的关联（如抗生素负面影响、特定菌群富集）与尚未验证的临床应用（如FMT、益生菌、生物标志物）。对于综述而言，它不仅是机制解释的来源，更是界定当前领域边界、识别研究空白（如缺乏前瞻性验证、技术标准化不足）以及制定临床实践指南的重要依据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9d36bdf3513e6445337f93a3a961bc3608c82c611",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::34a888801e8e6d821b26426340c87e03f660d9e8ccd4d5483b2edf8d0e593eaa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::962184581cfb05e426ebfc8edcdedd4a4593d37db28b91c7614734e2b8ab6462",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7922c614bdcb79bda3feb1d5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7922c614bdcb79bda3feb1d5",
      "source_handle": "P0363",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制描述主要基于前临床模型（小鼠）和部分人类体外/体内观察，部分人体内的确切浓度-效应关系未知。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了四种主要代谢轴（SCFAs、胆汁酸、色氨酸、多胺）的具体分子机制。包括SCFAs通过HDAC抑制和GPCR信号通路调节T细胞耗竭和巨噬细胞极化；色氨酸代谢中宿主IDO酶与细菌吲哚途径的竞争；胆汁酸受体信号对T细胞的抑制；以及多胺对髓系细胞的免疫抑制作用。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9d36bdf3513e6445337f93a3a961bc3608c82c611",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::34a888801e8e6d821b26426340c87e03f660d9e8ccd4d5483b2edf8d0e593eaa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::be1908b4cd83956d4cc33fa7c803521352287f6afe21f9ed30b37a0f46d1643d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a6f1f4bc22b83fc3c5edb3ee": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a6f1f4bc22b83fc3c5edb3ee",
      "source_handle": "P0363",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释肠道微生物组如何通过代谢产物远程调控TME免疫细胞状态，特别是T细胞功能和髓系细胞极化的分子基础。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9d36bdf3513e6445337f93a3a961bc3608c82c611",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::34a888801e8e6d821b26426340c87e03f660d9e8ccd4d5483b2edf8d0e593eaa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::964630ac6979a33b2320c7a017943eb0a7832d6b75c0a556015bc6567d3ce4ed",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::eb76630b77251fb97c0e9d0a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::eb76630b77251fb97c0e9d0a",
      "source_handle": "P0363",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "证据主要来自黑色素瘤和NSCLC，其他实体瘤数据较少；相关性不等于因果性；生物标志物尚未 validated。",
        "contribution": "总结了关键临床观察：特定菌群（F. prausnitzii, A. muciniphila, B. longum）与ICI响应正相关；抗生素使用与预后不良相关；FMT在概念验证研究中显示部分逆转耐药的潜力。同时指出了这些发现的局限性（回顾性设计、小样本、技术异质性）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
