    },
    "atom::377cc3be601df49761f64750": {
      "atom_id": "atom::377cc3be601df49761f64750",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::02aaf0c6242cab7cd84d9c5d21f8f66af9c7e3ef3a3c8249d1906d216f629dbc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a7dc402b2fc8a26ccd9ea6a0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a7dc402b2fc8a26ccd9ea6a0",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管ICIs显著改善了癌症患者生存率，但客观缓解率仍低于30%。肠道微生物群已知能调节ICIs疗效，但其具体作用模式尚不明确。本研究旨在解决：肠道微生物代谢物如何具体调节抗肿瘤免疫？它们作为ICIs疗效增强剂或生物标志物的潜力如何？其背后的分子机制是什么？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d1cbcb9fa49b93c79b1987ab982054d20ee96528ae7b9f119986a7f206afd635",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9820954a67cf06885ec681f4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9820954a67cf06885ec681f4",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肠道微生物群及其衍生的代谢物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷、TMAO、色氨酸代谢物、次级胆汁酸等）对实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括PD-1/PD-L1和CTLA-4抗体）疗效的调节作用及潜在机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::50c0e9226e0b5aa87a65246a48943e48c0bb5d8b37e83cafdd2b33d9ba7e0f32",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::45f928c5f233046daedb50ad": {
      "atom_id": "atom::45f928c5f233046daedb50ad",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在梳理肠道微生物群通过其代谢产物调节抗肿瘤免疫并影响ICIs疗效的证据与机制。文章首先介绍了肿瘤微环境与免疫细胞的关系，随后分类详细讨论了短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）、肌苷、氧化三甲胺（TMAO）、色氨酸代谢物和次级胆汁酸等主要代谢物的功能、产生菌及分子机制（如HDAC抑制、GPR受体激活、AhR通路等）。文中特别指出了不同代谢物在不同癌症模型或ICIs类型中可能存在的相反效果（如丁酸盐在抗PD-1治疗中的促进作用与在抗CTLA-4治疗中的抑制作用），并探讨了基于代谢物的生物标志物预测、免疫佐剂开发及饮食干预等未来策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5dc65bff8321685fbed61116bce535ba224a1943d7fdec07d1fe9ec2ef2b9bcf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f38cbed5b61790a8d5171261": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f38cbed5b61790a8d5171261",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物代谢物如何作为‘敌人或朋友’调节ICIs疗效提供了详细的机制图谱和临床关联证据。其核心价值在于揭示了代谢物效应的异质性和双向性（如SCFAs的双刃剑效应），以及具体的分子通路（HDAC, GPR, AhR等）。这有助于在综述中解释为何某些微生物特征在不同研究中表现出不一致的预后价值，并为基于代谢物的联合治疗策略提供理论依据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f360799b1e71ea9afa1fcbea43d62056619cd7ca816c35ad6e3e2111e449ea58",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::5f8472029adf0f3c82178aab": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5f8472029adf0f3c82178aab",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些关联多为观察性或相关性，因果链条需结合机制部分理解；不同研究间的样本量和检测方法差异可能导致结果不可直接比较。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物代谢物与ICIs疗效关联的临床队列数据和动物模型结果。例如，指出粪便SCFAs浓度与PD-1治疗PFS正相关，但血清丁酸与CTLA-4治疗疗效负相关；TMAO高水平与较好响应相关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ed8dd713ceb2fcc95eda14ab6581488a077accccf970108bc5a4652768fe07c3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4b4cb460e61bf129e91e7914": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4b4cb460e61bf129e91e7914",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答‘肠道微生物组如何调节ICIs疗效’，展示代谢物作为疗效预测生物标志物的潜力，并说明这种调节作用并非单向，而是取决于代谢物类型、癌症类型和治疗靶点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::47f0be7f3e31294af084e9dcee616d580e4b1a5f659f40c0b5fb546c5a1a3c80",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6a458b7805c18e2d16c9bfdb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6a458b7805c18e2d16c9bfdb",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制多在体外或小鼠模型中验证，人体内的确切效力和剂量依赖关系尚不完全清楚；部分机制存在争议或复杂性（如肌苷在有无IFN-γ时的不同作用）。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了多种代谢物的分子机制。包括：SCFAs通过抑制HDAC、激活GPR41/43和调节mTOR通路影响T细胞分化和细胞因子产生；肌苷通过A2aR-cAMP-PKA通路促进Th1分化；TMAO通过PERK/Gasdermin-E途径诱导细胞焦亡；色氨酸代谢物通过AhR通路调节巨噬细胞和T细胞功能；次级胆汁酸通过抑制ROR-γt抑制Th17。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ed8dd713ceb2fcc95eda14ab6581488a077accccf970108bc5a4652768fe07c3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1ef3ed6bf346b8b4f55ea21d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1ef3ed6bf346b8b4f55ea21d",
      "source_handle": "P0413",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答‘哪些机制介导了这种效应’，提供具体的信号通路和细胞靶点，解释微生物代谢物如何重塑肿瘤微环境（TME）和全身免疫系统。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ec2a02729d6c1d88e1ca4fe504295babc856c1560275467c38a02f3276e5f840",
