      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f38a9953e66a68e09f3c7918": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f38a9953e66a68e09f3c7918",
      "source_handle": "P0575",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "在大型泛癌种队列中，抗生素 administered relative to immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) initiation 的不同时机（仅术前 vs. 仅术后）是否对患者的总生存期产生差异化的影响？特别是，术后暴露是否比术前暴露具有更强的负面预后关联？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abfcf11587495686a3fdc90846cdad2a36b96d1f9170b20018af4840cb171b16",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::17b77d9d0cc557c30777181a9d6ea6140fbd0e9ed78981382e4ae4147e0023aa",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::472ff540aee6ba8259769030": {
      "atom_id": "atom::472ff540aee6ba8259769030",
      "source_handle": "P0575",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "回顾性队列研究，基于加州大学健康系统（UC Health）六个学术医疗中心的去标识化电子健康记录（EHR）。纳入2014年1月至2024年12月期间接受PD-1、PD-L1或CTLA-4抑制剂治疗的成年实体瘤患者（n=21,108）。重点考察抗生素暴露时间窗（ICI启动前60天 vs. 启动后60天）与总生存期（OS）的关联。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abfcf11587495686a3fdc90846cdad2a36b96d1f9170b20018af4840cb171b16",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bf65c25104582368f20efdb4a222c01dcd2e930958ea0f0d0731bb7af2100777",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::860f648870445cc6aeafa56b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::860f648870445cc6aeafa56b",
      "source_handle": "P0575",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在解决既往文献中关于抗生素使用对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效影响的时间依赖性争议。通过大规模多中心真实世界数据，作者将抗生素暴露严格划分为“仅术前”、“仅术后”及“无暴露”，并调整了肿瘤类型、治疗线数及基线健康状况等混杂因素。研究发现，ICI启动后60天内的抗生素暴露显著增加死亡风险（HR 1.27），而启动前的暴露未显示显著的长期生存负面影响。这一结果挑战了仅关注基线抗生素使用的传统观点，提示ICI治疗早期的微生物群完整性对预后更为关键。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abfcf11587495686a3fdc90846cdad2a36b96d1f9170b20018af4840cb171b16",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0da61dbf819b086b691b3f3247e1844939a3b6807d832247c7e39516544d6784",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::456a456bd2c4cd3c989e373e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::456a456bd2c4cd3c989e373e",
      "source_handle": "P0575",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关键的流行病学证据，支持“抗生素使用时间窗”是调节ICI疗效的重要变量这一论点。它特别有助于解释为何不同研究中抗生素对ICI疗效的影响存在异质性（可能源于对术前/术后暴露定义的混淆）。其发现强调了ICI治疗早期阶段微生物群完整性的脆弱性，为机制假说提供了临床表型支持。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abfcf11587495686a3fdc90846cdad2a36b96d1f9170b20018af4840cb171b16",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::32db607e7998dddc3cfd26e481bb943589356be905e8c4d4a5a04c0742e49849",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d57ae0ae2e4be7b55f0e2a13": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d57ae0ae2e4be7b55f0e2a13",
      "source_handle": "P0575",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅为观察性关联，不能证明因果机制；未提供微生物组直接数据，仅作为间接代理指标；不同肿瘤类型的敏感性差异提示结论需结合肿瘤生物学背景解读，不能简单外推至所有实体瘤。",
        "contribution": "提供了大样本真实世界数据，量化了抗生素暴露时间与ICI疗效（OS）的关联强度。具体显示术后60天内暴露使死亡风险增加27%，而术前暴露无显著长期影响。这直接回应了“肠道微生物组如何调节ICI疗效”中的临床效应大小和时间依赖性问题。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abfcf11587495686a3fdc90846cdad2a36b96d1f9170b20018af4840cb171b16",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7b087c921442d6631743ac746a0ef55fb7b105a6cfbcd65d6655cddc7327aa87",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::38f6d46752ec852c7b68b0cc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::38f6d46752ec852c7b68b0cc",
      "source_handle": "P0575",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于论证抗生素暴露对ICI疗效的负面影响并非恒定不变，而是高度依赖于给药时机。可作为背景证据，说明为何在综合评估微生物组影响时必须考虑时间维度。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abfcf11587495686a3fdc90846cdad2a36b96d1f9170b20018af4840cb171b16",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2f9cab859adcaf63734ca0d5acd9d85c69b53084a153bfff91db3066eeff4318",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
