    },
    "atom::673d7d2c391219fa21071c50": {
      "atom_id": "atom::673d7d2c391219fa21071c50",
      "source_handle": "P0061",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "已知抗生素会改变肠道微生物群，假设其也可能改变对CPI的反应。由于来自真实世界环境的数据有限，本研究试图回答：在真实世界临床实践中，伴随使用抗生素是否影响CPI在晚期实体瘤患者中的疗效？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::bf3e35a7389266d71780c2b14ec5d3f58ccee4bcf2709b7d1c6aee470881772b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9495dc455b91d0ec8f9d10c7608eaacaa0ea9814a7b206e6c9080944977651a1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d51263fdfbf08bd5dc7e030b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d51263fdfbf08bd5dc7e030b",
      "source_handle": "P0061",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "印度孟买Tata纪念医院接受免疫检查点抑制剂（CPI）治疗的晚期实体瘤患者；回顾性审计前瞻性收集的数据库；抗生素使用记录涵盖CPI开始前两周及治疗期间。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::bf3e35a7389266d71780c2b14ec5d3f58ccee4bcf2709b7d1c6aee470881772b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b2a7f2fa43f2c732c2efe3eb5d6a35754dece24d3ba324543e1aa1ea90160421",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::831c0cb885481c7a3fa1febd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::831c0cb885481c7a3fa1febd",
      "source_handle": "P0061",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探讨在真实世界背景下，抗生素与免疫检查点抑制剂（CPI）的联合使用对晚期实体瘤患者疗效的影响。研究基于2015年8月至2018年11月间在印度孟买Tata纪念医院接受CPI治疗的患者队列，通过回顾性分析评估抗生素使用对无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）的影响。研究发现，虽然总体抗生素使用组与非使用组的PFS无显著差异，但OS存在显著趋势，且抗生素使用时长与OS密切相关，提示需谨慎使用抗生素。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::bf3e35a7389266d71780c2b14ec5d3f58ccee4bcf2709b7d1c6aee470881772b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::84bead5a549f994d2f2dc1f5a563500fd2f3466c22e1f0b3dca513edd0606550",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::663a5d3dba1bd7c861d62f50": {
      "atom_id": "atom::663a5d3dba1bd7c861d62f50",
      "source_handle": "P0061",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于抗生素使用（特别是使用时长）如何影响实体瘤患者免疫检查点抑制剂（CPI）疗效的真实世界观察数据。它直接关联到“肠道微生物群”作为潜在中介机制的假设，因为抗生素是破坏微生物群的主要干预手段。对于综述而言，这篇材料的关键价值在于区分了“任何抗生素使用”与“长期/高强度抗生素使用”对生存结果的差异化影响，为解释微生物群介导的疗效调节提供了临床表型证据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::bf3e35a7389266d71780c2b14ec5d3f58ccee4bcf2709b7d1c6aee470881772b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3f805e42f36b87ef2e238c7c0f1cf5460696fd91b0774ec8a6eb1aded42d026a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2cf089c06f172d00c248d02a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2cf089c06f172d00c248d02a",
      "source_handle": "P0061",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限晚期实体瘤患者；单中心数据；回顾性性质；未提供微生物群直接测量数据，仅通过抗生素使用作为代理指标；PFS无显著差异，限制了其对疾病控制能力的全面评价。",
        "contribution": "提供了抗生素使用与CPI疗效关联的临床观察证据。具体发现：总体抗生素使用与OS呈负向趋势（p=0.053）；更关键的是，抗生素使用时长>10天与显著缩短的OS（2.8个月 vs. 8.8个月, p=0.025）相关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::bf3e35a7389266d71780c2b14ec5d3f58ccee4bcf2709b7d1c6aee470881772b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e2e0a839519556feecaabf6156eed95077e544ef466e6dac700b332380919cae",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::68eb5ccbf20a9894f7494bd3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::68eb5ccbf20a9894f7494bd3",
      "source_handle": "P0061",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于支持“抗生素使用可能损害CPI疗效”的观点，并细化为“长期使用抗生素的危害更大”。帮助解释为何在某些临床情境下观察到CPI疗效降低，特别是在合并感染需要长期抗菌治疗时。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::bf3e35a7389266d71780c2b14ec5d3f58ccee4bcf2709b7d1c6aee470881772b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d39f2fd4bd7550e6e7c1bf2a58173c52d31ecf0c826781d457a9dd7ed1d5cc4c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b283454397bb24bd593fd444": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b283454397bb24bd593fd444",
      "source_handle": "P0061",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "不能证明因果机制；未检测微生物群组成变化；未排除其他混杂因素（如抗生素使用的指征本身可能与病情严重程度相关）；无法区分不同类别抗生素的影响。",
        "contribution": "间接支持微生物群介导机制的假说。通过展示抗生素（已知破坏微生物群的因素）与较差生存结果的关联，尤其是剂量/时长依赖性效应，为微生物群可能是CPI疗效调节器的理论提供了间接临床支持。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::bf3e35a7389266d71780c2b14ec5d3f58ccee4bcf2709b7d1c6aee470881772b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e2e0a839519556feecaabf6156eed95077e544ef466e6dac700b332380919cae",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3eb68229879017f33a9f2641": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3eb68229879017f33a9f2641",
      "source_handle": "P0061",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "在讨论机制时，可作为临床相关性证据，说明干扰微生物群（通过抗生素）会对治疗结果产生可测量的负面影响。有助于构建“抗生素->微生物群扰动->CPI疗效下降”的逻辑链条中的临床后果部分。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::bf3e35a7389266d71780c2b14ec5d3f58ccee4bcf2709b7d1c6aee470881772b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d39f2fd4bd7550e6e7c1bf2a58173c52d31ecf0c826781d457a9dd7ed1d5cc4c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
