      "variant_group": "field::c9cc7ea1a1223ec92811da5181d4737b796d140c7010cc4df93e0814a9986942",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::37377881090db7101f49c1ca": {
      "atom_id": "atom::37377881090db7101f49c1ca",
      "source_handle": "P0052",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已有研究表明肠道微生物群失调可能影响ICI疗效，且既往研究提示抗生素有害，但需要更新最新证据并更全面地评估抗生素对NSCLC患者ICI治疗的多项临床结局（包括生存、缓解和进展）的具体影响程度及时间依赖性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8503f14cf976f9cf371c40c9a243680a710102a9b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fe948f097a86bd9842d7e9252e8cab730661ee4d842861947175d6916b1b1d72",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::53cbcfda31c1102c91f23106": {
      "atom_id": "atom::53cbcfda31c1102c91f23106",
      "source_handle": "P0052",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗，暴露于抗生素（ABX）与未暴露的对比。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8503f14cf976f9cf371c40c9a243680a710102a9b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4aac1ec07d45cdb0bec6031ddf635fe6d8e8d60e12045845e400abda25cbde6e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c34c387964e101ba04f34906": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c34c387964e101ba04f34906",
      "source_handle": "P0052",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究是一项系统综述和荟萃分析，旨在更新并扩展作者此前在2020年发表的相关工作。通过检索PubMed及主要肿瘤学会议论文集，纳入截至2021年7月发表的评估抗生素使用对NSCLC患者ICI治疗临床结局影响的研究。研究综合了35个独立队列的数据，分析了总生存期（OS）、无进展生存期（PFS）、总体缓解率（ORR）和疾病进展率（PD），并根据抗生素暴露的时间窗口进行了亚组分析。结果显示，抗生素暴露显著降低患者的生存率和治疗反应率，增加疾病进展风险，特别是在ICI启动前后使用的危害更为明显。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8503f14cf976f9cf371c40c9a243680a710102a9b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::dd5ae7e59eaac1c5fda2a01d246c5d3e4667c692a7793c985f50236ff3377495",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7426c95f1e319501917a595d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7426c95f1e319501917a595d",
      "source_handle": "P0052",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于“抗生素使用”这一关键混杂因素或调节变量对“免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效”影响的定量证据。它证实了抗生素暴露与较差临床结局（生存、缓解、进展）之间的强关联，并提示了时间窗口的重要性。这对于解释肠道微生物群介导的ICI疗效变异具有直接的实证支持价值，可作为综述中关于“外部干预/药物相互作用”或“微生物群扰动后果”章节的核心数据源。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8503f14cf976f9cf371c40c9a243680a710102a9b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9f66f523b28b03d601e19ac05b1e18d6cfa495a7e48c9974e85f327b2747e517",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::728295ab171faf132c05750e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::728295ab171faf132c05750e",
      "source_handle": "P0052",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限于NSCLC人群，不能直接外推至所有实体瘤或其他癌症类型，除非有证据表明效应一致。未区分不同类别抗生素的影响。",
        "contribution": "提供了抗生素暴露作为负面调节因子影响ICI疗效的大样本荟萃分析数据（HR/OR值）。具体显示了OS HR=1.63, PFS HR=1.49, ORR OR=0.66, PD OR=1.98。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8503f14cf976f9cf371c40c9a243680a710102a9b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::007b31b86b4caddf59785b25d6e8dfd485c1f83246979372310b0279619db9e1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1f9783ac6958232edb69423b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1f9783ac6958232edb69423b",
      "source_handle": "P0052",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于回答“肠道微生物群如何调节ICI疗效”中的反面案例或干扰因素部分：即当微生物群被抗生素破坏时，疗效显著下降。提供具体的效应量估计。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8503f14cf976f9cf371c40c9a243680a710102a9b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cb0ea3b4313c0582f3ab29c86aad38f62aee25f9fe6b55191d782d35ed3c5614",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d0eb337a3b37ac077ee731ab": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d0eb337a3b37ac077ee731ab",
      "source_handle": "P0052",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "本综述本身未提供新的机制实验数据，仅汇总临床结局证据并引用其他研究的机制假说。不能据此推断具体的分子通路。",
        "contribution": "虽然不直接揭示分子机制，但通过确认抗生素（导致菌群失调）与疗效降低的强关联，间接支持了“微生物群完整性对ICI疗效至关重要”的假设。文中提及的两种潜在机制（细菌分子的免疫调节作用、共生菌与肿瘤抗原的抗原模拟）为机制探讨提供了文献背景。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8503f14cf976f9cf371c40c9a243680a710102a9b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::007b31b86b4caddf59785b25d6e8dfd485c1f83246979372310b0279619db9e1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c508c38f98262c42a3e7ddfc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c508c38f98262c42a3e7ddfc",
      "source_handle": "P0052",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于构建“机制”部分的逻辑链条：抗生素->菌群失调->疗效降低。引用的参考文献（如Gopalakrishnan et al., Routy et al.）可作为机制解释的直接依据。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a30c4034486bacfda33c1c8503f14cf976f9cf371c40c9a243680a710102a9b",
