    },
    "atom::7dbc96a995ac40dd148d9062": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7dbc96a995ac40dd148d9062",
      "source_handle": "P0564",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "明确肠道微生物组的组成以及抗生素的使用如何具体影响免疫检查点抑制剂在癌症治疗中的有效性，并探讨基于此提高免疫治疗疗效的措施。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a3c6e8f18d29cdc982e82a7b806438cad30317d7263fd43d50d99324be8e7ea",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::dc94c6aec10bbb6d9162b96edde567cdc6b9537c035ca31271817b8396b9c681",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7d0effab6d142d7263852487": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7d0effab6d142d7263852487",
      "source_handle": "P0564",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "2016-2021年间发表的关于肠道微生物组和抗生素对实体瘤患者免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效影响的临床研究及综述文章。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a3c6e8f18d29cdc982e82a7b806438cad30317d7263fd43d50d99324be8e7ea",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::13d7e1753ee50c124841070ed24828c7fe80f4534f5bab04d3b2df980c8cae3e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7f4ddab69407e2fc5ed14a95": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7f4ddab69407e2fc5ed14a95",
      "source_handle": "P0564",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇系统综述，旨在分析肠道微生物组和抗生素如何影响癌症患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的疗效。研究通过检索PubMed和Science Direct数据库，筛选出16篇符合条件的文章（包括回顾性和前瞻性队列研究），并对数据进行了提取和质量评估。研究发现，富含特定微生物的肠道菌群对ICI反应不同，而抗生素的使用通常会对ICI的疗效产生负面影响，且抗生素使用时机、种类及疗程均会影响预后指标如无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a3c6e8f18d29cdc982e82a7b806438cad30317d7263fd43d50d99324be8e7ea",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bd21f1234d9a0f18be672633620f932a2a8c7755cd8e1cf97da81f374f398e21",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2a2f8b9930687ebb6b36e60e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2a2f8b9930687ebb6b36e60e",
      "source_handle": "P0564",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述提供了关于肠道微生物组特征（特定菌属丰度、多样性）和抗生素暴露史作为ICI疗效生物标志物的临床证据汇总。它详细列举了不同菌属（如Faecalibacterium, Bacteroides）与ICI反应及毒性的关联，以及抗生素使用时机和类型对预后的影响，可作为解释“微生物如何调节ICI疗效”这一核心问题的关键背景素材和实证支持。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a3c6e8f18d29cdc982e82a7b806438cad30317d7263fd43d50d99324be8e7ea",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fe629f2997c5b85fd9a0ef324e752eab03408fa16c099d9d0849c48fe49011a1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::378b189305859ec1017861f7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::378b189305859ec1017861f7",
      "source_handle": "P0564",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "主要基于回顾性和前瞻性队列研究的关联性数据，部分研究样本量较小；不同癌种间结果可能存在异质性；抗生素影响的因果关系受限于观察性设计。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的临床观察结果：富含Faecalibacterium和Firmicutes的患者对ICI反应更好，而富含Bacteroides的患者反应较差；抗生素使用（尤其是广谱和长期）与PFS和OS缩短相关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3a3c6e8f18d29cdc982e82a7b806438cad30317d7263fd43d50d99324be8e7ea",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::48086042d616118366530acaf20d0e546c3ed8176ef6b9a7c7eafdfdd40ec852",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
