    },
    "atom::b15ece65adf52307d0d4603a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b15ece65adf52307d0d4603a",
      "source_handle": "P0547",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9f15c7e72e245cc0726cc9a6dfb762781c1f159ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d6860570db4b197b184da55b018efaf5390a55a653dd41f65314877fc07fde38",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::12a473fd391ca6f028dc19d0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::12a473fd391ca6f028dc19d0",
      "source_handle": "P0547",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管肠道微生物群在塑造抗肿瘤免疫和ICI反应中起关键作用，但抗生素暴露可能破坏微生物多样性从而损害免疫疗法疗效。然而，这种关联在不同实体瘤中的一致性和magnitude尚不清楚。本研究旨在明确抗生素暴露与ICI治疗生存结局之间的关联及其异质性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9f15c7e72e245cc0726cc9a6dfb762781c1f159ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::066b85d2cce6ee5ac3f54ffaab862ed6728587ff8a24c48c2f5a77484709b689",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7c88c04e7cfd2c8eb7a0a89f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7c88c04e7cfd2c8eb7a0a89f",
      "source_handle": "P0547",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "成人实体瘤患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的情境；聚焦抗生素暴露（治疗前30-60天或治疗期间）与临床生存结局的关联。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9f15c7e72e245cc0726cc9a6dfb762781c1f159ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ffd9c4566f89b6ba0fed63a8b346447640c1388bba0daae00f2ea30f5074b930",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f1614b0b59663a73ab11b6e7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f1614b0b59663a73ab11b6e7",
      "source_handle": "P0547",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究通过系统综述方法，评估了抗生素暴露对实体瘤患者ICI疗效的影响。基于PubMed数据库检索过去10年的人类研究，最终纳入25项涉及约73,567名患者的研究。结果显示，在大多数实体瘤中，抗生素暴露与较差的总生存期（OS）相关，但在黑色素瘤和特定肝细胞癌（HCC）亚组中存在例外。研究还提示不同类别抗生素可能存在特异性影响，并据此提出了临床用药建议。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9f15c7e72e245cc0726cc9a6dfb762781c1f159ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::02d9b09eaf3c390e4d63ec401b2ce1ec3a98cae177b55eb751d4e3b5bbfb02a2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6cf2740fec7245d0581d8cce": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6cf2740fec7245d0581d8cce",
      "source_handle": "P0547",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为“肠道微生物群如何调节ICI疗效”这一主题提供了关键的流行病学证据支持，特别是证实了抗生素干扰（作为微生物群破坏的代理指标）与不良预后之间的广泛关联。它有助于解释为什么在某些肿瘤类型中ICI疗效受损，并为机制假设（微生物介导）提供了间接的临床相关性证据。同时，其识别出的例外情况（黑色素瘤、HCC）为探讨情境依赖性机制提供了切入点。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9f15c7e72e245cc0726cc9a6dfb762781c1f159ab",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::eccb40ddbbf086019348b5b8a1f1a495a9aacbf863c170e4d94542e5aa8a5b4a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9b83286e3a75f0d290f5de18": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9b83286e3a75f0d290f5de18",
      "source_handle": "P0547",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅证明关联性，不直接展示微生物群的具体变化机制。黑色素瘤中的阴性结果提示该关联并非普适，需结合其他文献解释为何黑色素瘤对微生物群扰动相对不敏感或存在补偿机制。",
        "contribution": "提供了抗生素暴露（微生物群破坏的主要诱因）与ICI疗效负相关的实证数据。具体而言，它量化了在多数实体瘤中抗生素使用导致生存率下降的风险幅度（HR 1.08-2.55），并指出了黑色素瘤中无显著关联的反例。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e8d01d45808cf092b87f9be9f15c7e72e245cc0726cc9a6dfb762781c1f159ab",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
